---
// Override of Starlight's ThemeProvider: FunnyGuilds is light-only, matching
// the landing page (which has no dark variant and no toggle at all). There is
// no ThemeSelect in Header.astro anymore, so this is the only thing standing
// between a visitor's OS dark preference and Starlight's default (unbranded)
// dark theme — always force light, ignoring any stored preference from
// before this change and ignoring `prefers-color-scheme` entirely.
---

{/* Inlined to avoid a flash of the wrong theme. */}
<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'light';
</script>
